{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act51side", "eventName": "人們，我們", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "PA-7", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "死結兩端", "storyInfo": "透過分銷緊缺的能源，弒君者與聖駿堡的工人們建立了連繫。為了與能源的供應方保持聯絡，弒君者決定尋找新的通訊設備，而偶然遇見的古米正好為她提供了線索。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_towerinside", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>聖駿堡，羅德島臨時辦事處</><p=2>冬季舞會一週前</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_both", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 2.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$path_intro", "key": "$path_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "堅雷女士，我來提交近期的報告——", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……堅雷女士？", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "fadeout": "true", "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 15.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_heavyobject_putdown", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "眼前只有一片混亂，看不出任何有人的蹤跡。弒君者開始把面前的紙箱搬開，試圖幫自己清出一條道路。"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼還是這麼亂……連走路的地方都沒有。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "堅雷——", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5, "bstart": 0.3, "bend": 0.5}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是誰在外面？", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "堅雷教官不在，可以把報告給我。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，是你。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "堅雷女士呢？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不知道，我也剛從外面回來沒幾天，現在辦事處裡只有我和拉達——就是古米，只有我們兩個在。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正式建立辦事處的事剛定案，其他人應該都在到處辦手續。我馬上也要出去一趟，有份學生聯合會的稿件需要儘快在這幾天發出去——", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的報告在這裡，麻煩你轉交一下。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……好。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有什麼事嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃……", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然你看起來好像不願意跟我們說話，總是獨來獨往，但大家都是烏薩斯人，如今又都是羅德島的幹員。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在新建辦事處，什麼都要從頭開始，我想，也許我們可以互相幫助，提高一點效率。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你們需要什麼？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是！我是想說，如果你有什麼需要，是可以向辦事處、向我們尋求幫助的，懂嗎？沒必要什麼事都自己硬撐。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#6$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然，如果我們需要，也會找你的。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "教官說你除了定期遞交報告之外，和辦事處的人沒有任何交集，雖然我覺得各司其職也不錯，但你剛好來了，我就說一聲。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不會希望我頻繁出現在這裡的。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別擅自決定我的想法。我知道你和切城，甚至和整合運動有關係，但你到底做了什麼，我不知道，也暫時不打算去瞭解。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對我們來說那是個會反覆開裂的傷口，但什麼都躲著也不會讓它真正癒合。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更重要的是，你和我們站在一起，現在又正是缺人的時候，這就夠了。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，如果你需要幫助，不要忘了告訴我們。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂！", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果需要，我會的。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 1.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g1_sjbstreet_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>聖駿堡，學院濱河街道警察分局</><p=2>12月24日 7:45 A.M.</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_both", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 2.0}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "柳德米拉！", "name": "被捕的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我正想去保釋你。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就感謝有人做好事，又幫我們省了一筆保釋金吧！", "name": "被捕的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是怎麼被放出來的？剛才的爆炸聲又是……", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——都逃跑——", "name": "遠處的聲音"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "快追——！", "name": "遠處的聲音"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聖駿堡嘛，這種事情也不稀奇。", "name": "被捕的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先別說了，要是站在這裡等那些蠢警察過來，我肯定又要被抓進去關了。", "name": "被捕的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……先別回去，跟我走。我還有事要問你。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_oldwarehouse_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你怎麼知道我被條子帶走了？我還以為自己要在那裡被關到天荒地老呢。", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人看到你被警察問話，住在你對面的那個小孩，記得嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小孩？紅頭髮的那個？我只記得他看起來很陰森，有點討人厭——", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要以貌取人。你手上的貨都賣完了嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有一個人沒跟我碰頭，被抓走之前我就是在等他。奧多耶夫區的那個……叫什麼呢？", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "魯斯，理髮師，住在第五大道，他家裡有兩個剛出生的孩子，妻子死於流感併發症。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對……對，是他。除了他之外，其他人我都已經交接好了。", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "能量轉換器的錢，他們都是怎麼付的？", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？不是不用付錢嗎？只要持續找我們買貨，能量轉換器就算是送給他們了。", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……原來你在考我！我有這麼不可靠嗎？", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可靠的人一般不會讓自己被抓進看守所裡。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別提了，聊事情，聊事情就好！", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在擔心我或者其他人背著你用能量轉換器賺差價嗎？", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不會的，現在大家都對你心服口服了，全靠你，我們才沒被凍死，謝謝你還來不及呢——", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我理解你們中有的人想多賺些錢的理由，但方法不該是去剝削比自己生活得更困難的人，這不是我選擇分銷時想看到的。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我有其他管道，卻選擇和你們分銷而不是獨自經營，這樣做是徒增風險，你們應該明白。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說真的，我到現在都不懂你為什麼要做這麼吃力不討好的事……寧願自己吃虧，也要提供便利給其他人。", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "魯斯那邊我已經交接好了，但之後招攬新顧客的事需要暫停一段時間，有消息我再通知你。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？那我們這段時間的供應會被切斷嗎？", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之前的儲備還能支撐現有顧客的需要，大概能維持兩週左右，在這段期間我會想辦法接上貨源。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果有新的顧客找上門來，小心辨認，用我給你的那些錢，能幫的話就幫一下，但不要告訴他們供應鏈的問題，以免引起恐慌。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我當然是相信你的……有什麼我能幫你的嗎？", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用，這是我的責任。接下來我可能會出城幾天，如果有人問起我的動向，你幫我應付一下。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這個好說，但如果真的有什麼事，我該怎麼聯絡你？", "name": "被捕的工人"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還是來這裡，留封信給我，像我之前教你們的那樣。", "name": "弒君者"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g15_wideunder", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "柳德米拉！好久沒在下面看到你了，你要出城嗎？", "name": "熱情的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，有點事要處理。前面哪個出口現在沒人守著？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "都有，不過他們看到是你，肯定不會攔你的。", "name": "熱情的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最近沒有可疑的人試圖從動力層進來，對吧？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有，警察巡邏的頻率也變低了，如果你問的是哪個出口沒有警察，答案是一樣的。他們只在固定的時間過來，大部分的時候都是我們自己看著。", "name": "熱情的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，謝謝你。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早點回來哦！", "name": "熱情的工人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness01_intro", "key": "$darkness01_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……應該是這裡……", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "弒君者蹲下身，抹去地上的積灰，一道用刀鋒鑿出來的印記逐漸清晰。"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抬頭望去，一模一樣的緊急逃生梯被整齊地安裝在各級結構之間。她攀上其中一架逃生梯，來到動力層的更深處。"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_climbmetalladder"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "29_g3_cottage", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽得到嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_transmissionget"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "group_interclude_square_common", "char": "？？？", "switch": "true", "style": 1.0, "size": "400, 720", "offset": "300,0", "channel": 3.0, "tsfrom": "0,1", "tsto": "1,1", "tsduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你那邊安全嗎？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是新的安全屋，已經確認過沒有竊聽器和監視器。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，我時間有限……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你還好嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不太好，但這不重要。我們偷偷往聖駿堡轉移能源這件事很有可能已經被發現了，我暫時還沒有受到處罰……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們已經翻新了通訊基地台，下一步很有可能是新建能源管道，然後把原來的那條廢棄。在這之前，我們必須做好兩手準備。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還打算繼續在要新建的管道上動手腳？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是打算，而是必須。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原本的管道就已經算得上是薩列夫格勒區專屬的了，現在他們大概想把新管道直接鋪設至皇宮，連其他的貴族也不管了。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說是為了“節省資源”，但不斷新建不知道什麼時候就會被天災摧毀的管道就不是一種浪費了嗎？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我聽說這邊已經有工人被抽調走了，聖駿堡沒有任何相關消息嗎？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有，聖駿堡本身……有它的問題。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是指之前提到過的那些學生——", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算礦脈枯竭的消息沒能被封鎖，你們正在研究的東西還是給了議會拖延的時間。加上第四集團軍前不久也陷入了自己內部的動亂……", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "貴族、軍隊、工人，這裡暫時都沒人輕舉妄動，除了對這些背後的暗湧一無所知的學生。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，我不是在指責你。只是，如果你能告訴我更多關於你們正在研究的計劃——", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先說正事吧。在新管道蓋好之前，原先的那條應該還會繼續使用，只是我們必須得更換通訊方式了。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我記得你現在用的通訊裝置，連接的是外國公司的獨立線路？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對，租用了烏薩斯境內外資公司的通訊基地台。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這就是問題。就算是外資公司，只要基地台在烏薩斯境內，就還是可能會受到嚴密監控，在遠北“廣播”事件之後更是如此。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "每次都更換匿名通訊頻道也不行嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在這邊的通訊基地台被翻新了，很難說會不會加了什麼新功能。你能找到獨立搭建線路的無線電通訊設備嗎？不經過商用基地台的那種？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就像是，更精密的、稀有的軍用級設備？那可能需要花點時間。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就試試看吧。如果你找到了，可以繼續用這個頻道嘗試聯絡我。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果沒有……那恐怕就只能等我找到機會，再主動聯絡你了。要是兩週之後我還沒有消息，你就銷毀所有和我聯絡過的痕跡。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我們都先想想辦法吧。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "保重。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，保重。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true", "tsduration": 0.5, "tsfrom": "1,1", "tsto": "0,1"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>聖駿堡，羅德島臨時辦事處</><p=2>冬季舞會數日後</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_both", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 2.0}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$distressed_intro", "key": "$distressed_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真的真的不能出去幫忙一下嗎？", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "烈夏姐留下一封信就走了，真理姐她們也幾乎沒回過辦事處，難道她們不需要我的幫助嗎？", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬姐是為了我才被抓走的，但我什麼也做不到——", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "古米，我理解你的擔憂，但在下一批駐守幹員抵達聖駿堡之前，必須有人留在這裡，幫忙處理辦事處業務。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#10$1"}, {"id": 343, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "新建感染者收治中心、協助政府進行感染者登記和管理，還有很多事等著我們去做呢。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，這些也是讓正在外面奔走或暫時陷入困境的她們，沒有後顧之憂的重要任務！", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#7$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這些都很重要，我明白。但如果我唯獨在救凜冬姐這件事上幫不上忙……", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不想這樣。那天要不是我出了狀況，凜冬姐也不會被抓走！", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#7$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我理解你的心情，小熊，但我也答應了真理她們要保護——", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#10$1"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬在嗎？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#8$1"}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬姐被警察抓走了——咦，弒君者小姐！", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……可以直接叫我柳德米拉。你說凜冬被警察抓走了是什麼意思？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……該死。我該早幾天過來的。你們知道她現在在哪裡嗎？我能幫什麼忙？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 375, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬在封鎖區，我們已經在想辦法救她了。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}, {"id": 377, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "封鎖區？卡托加區？那個地方基本上已經是巴普洛維奇的獨立王國了，你們——羅德島在其中能做什麼？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}, {"id": 381, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是烏薩斯學生自治團……是這些孩子們，自己在想辦法救自己的同伴。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#10$1"}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我沒有幫上忙！凜冬姐是因為我才被抓進去的，我卻什麼也做不了……", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1"}, {"id": 385, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們確定凜冬目前被關在封鎖區裡？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"}, {"id": 387, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露透過多方查證確認了這點，她也已經透過某種管道見過那位巴普洛維奇大人。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}, {"id": 389, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她也沒辦法救出凜冬……或者說，是凜冬自己不想走。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬姐不想出來？", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1"}, {"id": 393, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你為什麼這麼說——", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#8$1"}, {"id": 395, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……直覺。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 397, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "辦事處有沒有更新型號的通訊器？獨立搭建線路的那種，不經過商用通訊基地台的。這幾天我找了很多管道，連黑市都沒人出售。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 398, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這種東西聽起來是只有各國軍方，或者可露希爾那種喜歡自己胡搞瞎搞的傢伙才會有的。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#9$1"}, {"id": 400, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除非特別申請，不然普通辦事處一般都沒有這種等級的配備。你要做什麼？", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}, {"id": 402, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "救人。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 404, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露說封鎖區處於通訊靜默狀態，就算有這種通訊器也沒用。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}, {"id": 406, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（低聲）不，這是為了聯絡幫我偷電的人。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 408, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我和那個人的聯絡很有可能已經被發現了，需要換個更安全的方式。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 409, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.2, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "偷——", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#2$1"}, {"id": 412, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "偷電？！", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}, {"id": 415, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噓。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1"}, {"id": 417, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……最近城裡出現便宜的能源，原來是你幹的。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#2$1"}, {"id": 419, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有很多人在幫忙。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 421, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好吧，我不該這麼驚訝的。你比我們早到烏薩斯，中央區的情報網路也是你搭起來的，能做到這種事也不奇怪。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#3$1"}, {"id": 423, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然辦事處沒有我要的通訊器，那我就先走了。你們保護好自己，凜冬那邊我也會想辦法的。", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 425, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_260_durnar_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你也小心，千萬別被發現了。", "name": "堅雷"}, "figure_art": "avg_260_durnar_1#7$1"}, {"id": 427, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（小聲）通訊器……通訊器？", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}, {"id": 429, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 430, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"}, {"id": 431, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 432, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想起來了！", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}, {"id": 433, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 434, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們在舞會那天用過的竊聽器，就是有個學生自己做的，凜冬姐說她還有一整套自己搭建的無線電通訊設備——", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1"}, {"id": 435, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 436, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這個學生現在在哪裡？", "name": "弒君者"}, "figure_art": "avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1"}, {"id": 437, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}}, {"id": 438, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我不知道。那個東西是凜冬姐借到的，可能只有她才知道那個人在哪裡。", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}, {"id": 439, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 440, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 441, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 442, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 443, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 444, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 445, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 446, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 447, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}